<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Hagaia</book>
  <para style="h">Hagaia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hagaia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagaia</para>
  <para style="mt">Hagaia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Daria lal kum hnihna, thla rukna, ni khat ni chuan Lalpa thu zâwlnei Hagaia hmangin Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela, Judai ramawptu hnênah leh Jehozadaka fapa Josua, Puithiam lalber hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hêng mite hian, Lalpa In sak a la hun rih lo ve, an ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu chu zâwlnei Hagaia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka in a chhiat rem rum laia, nangni, in ṭha leh nuam tak taka in chêng hi a dik em ni?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In awm dân hi ngun takin chhût teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam tak in chîng a, tlêm tê in thar a; in ei a, in tlai si lo; in sin a, in lum si lo, inhlawhfa hlawh chu ip pawpa thlâk ang mai a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “In awm dân hi ngun takin chhût teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlângahte han kal ula, thing han la ula, Tempul chu sa rawh u. Chu chu ka lâwmzâwng tak a ni; tichuan, chawimawiin ka awm dâwn nia,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tam tak seng in beisei a, en teh u, a lo tlêm hle si. Ina in rawn hawn pawh ka lo chhêm darh a. Eng vângin nge?” tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Mahni in sa-in in buai ṭheuh va, ka in chu chhe rem rum a, in hlamchhiah vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, nangmahni avângin vân daifîm a tla lo vang a, leiin thlai rah a chhuahsak hek lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram pumah khua ka tikhêng ang a, tlâng te, buh te, grep te, Oliv te a ro zo vang a, leia thil ṭo zawng zawng te, mihring te, ram te leh in thil chîn zawng zawng chuan an tuar ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela te, Jehozadaka fapa Josua, Puithiam lalberte leh mi la awm zawng zawngte chuan, Lalpa , an Pathian thu, zâwlnei Hagaia thute chu an zâwm a. Ani chu Lalpa , an Pathian tirh a ni a; tichuan, mipui chu Lalpa hmaah chuan an zâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipuite hnênah Lalpa chuan, “In hnênah ka awm zêl dâwn,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela, Judai ram awptu te, Jehozadaka fapa Josua, Puithiam lalber te leh mi la awm zawngte rilru chu a chawk tho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Daria lal kum hnihna, thla rukna, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni chuan Engkim Lalpa , an Pathian In sa ṭan tûr chuan an lo thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarihna, ni sawmhnih leh pakhat ni chuan Lalpa thu zâwlnei Hagaia hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sealtiela fapa, Zerubabela, Judai ram awptu hnênah te, Jehozadaka fapa Josua, Puithiam lalber hnênahte leh mi la awm zawng zawng hnênah te heti hian thu sawi rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tûn hmaa he in ropui lai hmu phâk in zîngah tu nge awm? Tûna mi hi eng nge ang in tih? Nêp in ti hle e lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang Zerubabel, ṭan la rawh,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Jehozadaka fapa Josua, Puithiam lalber, nang pawh ṭan la rawh. Nangni, ram chhûnga mi tinrêngte u, ṭan la rawh u,” tih hi Lalpa thu chhuak a ni. “Thawk zêl ula, in hnênah ka awm reng ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aigupta ram aṭanga in chhuah laia in hnêna thu ka thlun tawh ang khân ka Thlarau in hnênah a awm reng a, zâm rêng rêng suh u,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Rei lo tê-ah lei leh vân te, tuipui leh khawmualte ka sâwinghîng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnamte chu ka sâwinghîng ang a, hnam tinrêngin an sum leh paite chu an rawn la khâwm ang a, he in hi ropuinain a khat ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tangkarua hi ka ta a ni, rangkachak pawh ka ta a ni,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “A hmasa ai khân tûna mi hi a ropui zâwk ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“He hmunah hian thlamuanna ka pe dâwn a ni,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Daria lal kum hnihna, thla kuana, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni chuan Lalpa thu zâwlnei Hagaia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hemi chungchângah hian Dânin eng nge a sawi puithiamte zâwt rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin emaw sa thianghlim a puan hmâwrah fûn sela, chu sa fûn chuan chhang emaw, satuihâng emaw, uain emaw, hriak emaw chaw eng pawh a deh a thianghlim ve ang em?” tiin. Puithiamte chuan, “Thianghlim ve lo vang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hagaia chuan, “Mitthi ruang khawih avângin mi bawlhhlawhin hêng thilte hi tawk sela, a bawlhhlawh ang em?” a ti a. Puithiamte chuan, “Aw, a bawlhhlawh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Hagaian, “Ka mit hmuhin hêng mite leh he hnam hi chutiang chu an ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; “An thawh rah zawng zawng te, an thilhlante pawh a bawlhhlawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Lalpa Tempul lungphûm in phûm hma leh tûn hnu hunte hi vawiin aṭangin ngun takin chhût rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Phur sawmhnih thar beiseiin phur sâwm chauh a thar a; uain ûm sawmnga neih beiseiin ûm sawmhnih chauh a neih ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In thawh chhuah zawng zawng a hrikin ka tichhia a, a ngêt te, rialte hmanga ka hrem che u pawhin ka lam in lo hawi duh chuang lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Vawiin ni sawmhnih leh pali ni, thla kuana, Tempul lungphûm in rem zawh ni aṭang hian ngun takin chhût teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Buh inah a chî a la awm em? grep te, theipui te, theibuhfai te, oliv-te rah lo mah sela tûn aṭangin mal ka sâwm ang che u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu chumi thla, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni vêk chuan a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Judai ramawptu, Zerubabela chu, lei leh vân ka tinghîng dâwn tih hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalte ka titlâwm ang a, ram dang sawrkâr chaknate ka tichhe vek ang. An sakawr-tawlailîrte leh a khalhtute chu leiah ka theh thlu ang a, sakawr leh a chungchuangte an tlu phung ang a, ngûnhnâmin an inchhun hlum ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “Chumi ni chuan, ka chhiahhlawh, Zerubabel, Sealtiela fapa, ka chelh tlat ang che,” Lalpa chuan a ti. “Ka thlang tawh che a, ka hming nemna zungbun atân ka siam ang che,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
